# Splitting function synthetics for various Earth models (S20RTS and / or Crust5.1, 
# as well as the addition of CMB topography models on top. 
# These files are created for all modes in the data_list_arwen-paula file. 

# In each file, splitting function coefficients are given for each mode, organised in the following way:

l s t cst_syn 
l s t cst_syn 
l s t cst_syn 
l s t cst_syn

with:
- l:	     the angular order of the mode 
- s:         the degree of the spherical harmonic degree (from 0 to smax)
- t:         the order of the spherical harmonic degree (from 0 to 2*smax
- cst_syn:   the predicted splitting function coefficients (in raw format)

